Package: modelgate
Type: Package
Title: Pre-Deployment Governance Gate for Statistical and Machine Learning Models
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Adetutu", "Olubusoye", , "olubusoyeadetutu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Vangelis", "Oden", role = c("aut", "cph"),
           comment = "author of bdp-model-gate, the reference Python implementation")
  )
Description: Runs a battery of automated checks on a model and its validation
    data before the model is promoted to production, and returns a single
    verdict (PASS, NEEDS_REVIEW or BLOCKED) that a pipeline can branch on.
    The design, thresholds and verdict semantics follow the Python library
    'bdp-model-gate' (<https://pypi.org/project/bdp-model-gate/>), which this
    package is a native R port of.
